    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">E-Signatures for Real Estate</h1>

    <p>Real estate moves fast. If you're printing documents, driving them across town, and waiting for wet signatures, you're losing deals. Check our <a href="/tools/roi-calculator">ROI Calculator</a> to see how much time that costs you.</p>

    <h2>Sign anywhere, instantly</h2>
    <p>Whether it's a residential lease, a commercial NDA, or a purchase agreement, usignpdf ensures that electronic signatures are captured legally and securely. Under the <a href="/legality/us-esign-act">ESIGN Act</a>, electronic signatures for most real estate transactions carry the exact same legal weight as a pen-and-paper signature.</p>

    <p><em>Note: If you are dealing with testamentary trusts, wills, or documents requiring a notary, check our <a href="/tools/legality-checker">Legality Checker</a> first, as those often require physical signatures.</em></p>
